                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans are working to extend Trump\u2019s tax cuts for the wealthiest Americans. To pay for it, they're cutting $300 billion from vital nutrition programs like SNAP, which helps 42 million Americans to put food on the table.\n\nIn our district, 1 in 9 families rely on SNAP\u2014half of whom are children.\n\nAs Maryland's only voice on @HouseAgDems, I'll keep fighting these cruel cuts and push for a real bipartisan Farm Bill that supports our farmers and families.\n\nStay tuned. https://t.co/ealirESJ27",
